#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:19
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"JPEG XL (``.jxl``) is a new royalty-free image file format. It supports :ref:"
"`lossy compression mode <lossless_compression>` designed for photographs "
"similar to the :ref:`JPEG <file_jpeg>` file format, and also :ref:`lossless "
"compression mode <lossless_compression>` similar to formats like :ref:`PNG "
"<file_png>`. In addition, it also supports saving animations with multiple "
"frames like :ref:`GIF <file_gif>`."
msgstr ""
"JPEG XL (''.jxl'') je nov format slikovne datoteke brez licenčnine. Podpira :"
"ref:'lossy kompresijo način ' namenjen za fotografije, podobne "
"<lossless_compression>:ref:'JPEG <file_jpeg>' format datoteke, in tudi :"
"ref:'lossless stiskanje način ' podobno formatov, kot "
"<lossless_compression>so :ref:'PNG <file_png>'. Poleg tega podpira tudi "
"shranjevanje animacij z več okvirji, kot so :ref:'GIF <file_gif>'."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:21
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When deciding between lossy and lossless compression modes, the same advice "
"for :ref:`JPEG <file_jpeg>` and :ref:`PNG <file_png>` applies. For images "
"with a lot of gradients, like full scale paintings, lossy compression may "
"work very well to produce small files with very little visual quality loss. "
"But for images with a lot of sharp contrasts, like text and comic book "
"styles, lossless compression is usually the better choice."
msgstr ""
"Pri odločanju med načini stiskanja izgube in brez izgub velja enak nasvet "
"za :ref:'JPEG <file_jpeg>' in :ref:'PNG<file_png>'. Za slike z veliko "
"gradientov, kot so slike polne lestvice, izguba stiskanje lahko deluje zelo "
"dobro, da proizvajajo majhne datoteke z zelo malo izgube vizualne kakovosti. "
"Toda za slike z veliko ostrih kontrastov, kot so slogi besedila in stripov, "
"brez izgube stiskanje je običajno boljša izbira."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:23
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For JPEG XL files using lossy compression, it is not advised to save over "
"the same file multiple times. The lossy compression will cause the file to "
"reduce in quality each time you save it. This is a fundamental problem with "
"lossy compression methods. Instead you should use the lossless compression "
"mode, or a working file format while you are working on the image."
msgstr ""
"Za DATOTEKE JPEG XL z izgubo stiskanja ni priporočljivo večkrat shraniti v "
"isto datoteko. Izguba stiskanja bo povzročila zmanjšanje kakovosti datoteke "
"vsakič, ko jo shranite. To je temeljni problem z metodami stiskanja izgub. "
"Namesto tega morate med delom na sliki uporabiti način stiskanja brez izgub "
"ali obliko zapisa delovne datoteke."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:25
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It is possible to losslessly transcode JPEG images into JPEG XL. Transcoding "
"preserves the already-lossy compression data from the original JPEG image "
"without any quality loss caused by re-encoding, while making the file size "
"smaller than the original. To do this, you need to use specialized tools, "
"for example the :program:`cjxl` command line tool from `libjxl <https://"
"github.com/libjxl/libjxl>`_, to perform the conversion. Beware that you "
"*cannot* do this by opening the JPEG image in Krita and re-exporting it into "
"JPEG XL. Krita always exports files from the raw pixel data, therefore this "
"does *not* have the same effect as transcoding directly from JPEG to JPEG XL."
msgstr ""
"To je mogoče brez izgube kodirati JPEG slike v JPEG XL. Transcoding ohranja "
"že izgubo kompresijo podatkov iz izvirne slike JPEG brez izgube kakovosti, "
"ki jo povzroči ponovno kodiranje, hkrati pa velikost datoteke manjša od "
"izvirnika. Če želite to storiti, morate za izvedbo konverzije uporabiti "
"specializirana orodja, na primer orodje ukazne vrstice :p:'cjxl' iz »libjxl "
"<https://github.com/libjxl/libjxl>«_. Bodite pozorni, da tega *ne morete* "
"storiti tako, da odprete sliko JPEG v Kriti in jo ponovno izvozite v JPEG "
"XL. Krita vedno izvozi datoteke iz surovih podatkov o pikslih, zato to nima "
"** enakega učinka kot transkodiranje neposredno iz JPEG na JPEG XL."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:27
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Exporting animations from Krita as JPEG XL is supported, though this "
"flattens all layers in the image. To export JPEG XL animations, use :term:"
"`Export...` from the :ref:`file_menu` and then saving or exporting to a ``."
"jxl`` file. Make sure to enable :guilabel:`Save as animated JPEG XL` in the "
"export options. This is different from :ref:`render_animation` in that it "
"does not use FFmpeg."
msgstr ""
"Izvažanje animacij iz Krite kot JPEG XL je podprto, čeprav to splošči vse "
"plasti na sliki. Če želite izvoziti animacije JPEG XL, uporabite :"
"term:'Export...' iz :ref:'file_menu' in nato shranite ali izvozite v "
"datoteko ''.jxl''. Preverite, ali želite omogočiti :guilabel:'Shrani kot "
"animirani JPEG XL' v možnostih izvoza. To se razlikuje od :"
"ref:'render_animation' v tem, da ne uporablja FFmpeg."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:30
msgid "Export Options"
msgstr "Možnosti Izvoza"

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:33
msgid "General"
msgstr "Splošno"

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:35
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"JPEG XL's encoder is designed to be fairly hands-off. Where in the case of "
"JPEG you'd have to select the appropriate quality, JPEG XL instead tries to "
"find the best quality for your image. What you instead choose is whether the "
"preferred compression is :ref:`lossy or lossless <lossless_compression>`, "
"and how much effort the encoder should put into finding the best compression "
"for your image, with more effort also meaning longer saving times."
msgstr ""
"JPEG XL-ov enkoder je zasnovan tako, da je dokaj predajajoč. Kjer morate v "
"primeru JPEG izbrati ustrezno kakovost, jpeg XL namesto tega poskuša najti "
"najboljšo kakovost za vašo sliko. Namesto tega se odločite, ali je želeno "
"stiskanje :ref:'izguba ali brez izgube ', in koliko truda mora enkoder "
"vnesti v iskanje najboljše stiskanje za vašo podobo, z več truda tudi pomeni "
"daljše varčevalne čase<lossless_compression>."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:37
msgid "Save as animated JPEG XL"
msgstr "Shrani kot animirani JPEG-XL"

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:38
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"JPEG XL has the ability to store small animations like :ref:`file_gif`. Its "
"animation capabilities are simple though, and specifically designed for "
"stylized content that doesn't have a lot of colors, like cel-animation. This "
"is because JPEG XL doesn't have intra-frame prediction, which is the best "
"way to store video files with a lot of colors like 3D animation, film and "
"painterly animation. We recommend you try using video rendering for "
"painterly animation instead."
msgstr ""
"JPEG XL ima možnost shranjevanje majhnih animacij, kot so :ref:'file_gif'. "
"Njegove animacijske zmogljivosti so preproste in posebej zasnovane za "
"stilizirano vsebino, ki nima veliko barv, kot je cel-animacija. To je zato, "
"ker JPEG XL nima napovedi znotraj okvirja, kar je najboljši način za "
"shranjevanje video datotek z veliko barv, kot so 3D animacija, film in "
"slikarska animacija. Priporočamo, da namesto tega poskusite uporabiti "
"uglasitev videoposnetkov za slikanje."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:40
msgid "Lossless encoding."
msgstr "Kodiranje brez izgub."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:41
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Whether to use :ref:`Lossless compression <lossless_compression>`. Like :ref:"
"`file_webp`, JPEG XL has a different way of encoding the images in lossless "
"and lossy mode, with the latter being closer to the way the original :ref:"
"`file_jpeg` encodes."
msgstr ""
"Ali uporabljati :ref:'Brez izgube stiskanje <lossless_compression>'. Kot :"
"ref:'file_webp', IMA JPEG XL drugačen način kodiranja slik v načinu brez "
"izgube in izgube, pri tem pa je slednji bližje načinu kodiranja originala :"
"ref:'file_jpeg'."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:43
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The encoder can give a better result if it is given more time. This slider "
"allows you to decide how much the encoder should prioritize quality over "
"speed. The different modes can be seen as presets [1]_:"
msgstr ""
"Enkoder lahko da boljši rezultat, če je dal več časa. Ta drsnik vam omogoča, "
"da se odločite, koliko bi moral koder dati prednost kakovosti nad hitrostjo. "
"Različne načine je mogoče videti kot prednastavitve [1]_:"

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:45
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Lightning -- A fast mode useful for lossless mode. Fastest possible values "
"for lossy compression, for lossless uses gradient predictors and fast "
"histograms, but no MA tree."
msgstr ""
"Strela - hiter način uporaben za način brez izgube. Najhitrejše možne "
"vrednosti za izgubo stiskanje, za brez izgube uporablja gradient napovedniki "
"in hitri histogrami, vendar ni MA drevo."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:46
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Thunder -- Both Lightning and Thunder are similar for Lossy, for lossless, "
"Thunder uses a fixed MA tree and gradient predictors."
msgstr ""
"Thunder -- Tako Strela kot Thunder so podobni za Lossy, za brez izgube, "
"Thunder uporablja fiksno MA drevo in gradient napovednike."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:47
#, fuzzy
msgid "Falcon -- Instead of using lossless mode, disables all options."
msgstr ""
"Falcon -- Namesto, da bi uporabili način brez izgube, onemogoči vse možnosti."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:48
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Cheetah -- Enables coefficient reordering, context clustering, and "
"heuristics for selecting DCT sizes and quantization steps."
msgstr ""
"Cheetah -- Omogoča reorderiranje koeficientov, kontekstno gručo in "
"hevristiko za izbiro velikosti DCT in korakov kvantizacijskega."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:49
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Hare -- Enables Gaborish Filtering, Chroma from Luma and estimates "
"quantization steps."
msgstr ""
"Hare -- Omogoča Filtriranje Gaborish, Chroma iz Lume in ocenjuje korake "
"kvantizacijske."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:50
#, fuzzy
msgid "Wombat -- Enables error diffusion quantization and DCT heuristics."
msgstr "Wombat -- Omogoča difuzijsko kvantizacijo napak in DCT hevristiko."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:51
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Squirrel -- Enables dots, patches and spline detection as well as context "
"clustering."
msgstr ""
"Veverica -- Omogoča točk, obližev in odkrivanje spline, kot tudi kontekstno "
"gručo."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:52
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Kitten -- Optimizes the adaptive quantization for a psychovisual metric."
msgstr ""
"Mucek - Optimizira prilagodljivo kvantizacijo za psihovizualno metriko."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:53
#, fuzzy
msgid "Tortoise -- Enables a more thorough adaptive quantization search."
msgstr "Želva -- omogoča temeljiteje prilagajanje kvantizacijskega iskanja."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:54
msgid "Tradeoff"
msgstr "Kompromis"

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:55
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You can force-enable several of the options in the :guilabel:`Advanced` "
"section even if they are disabled by the :guilabel:`Tradeoff` preset."
msgstr ""
"Več možnosti lahko omogočite v razdelku :guilabel:'Advanced', tudi če jih "
"onemogoči prednastavitev :guilabel:'Tradeoff'."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:57
msgid "Encoding Options"
msgstr "Možnosti kodiranja"

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:57
msgid "Decoding Speed"
msgstr "Hitrost dekodiranja"

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:57
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Decoding speed can be improved by allowing certain optimizations. However, "
"this will lead to some quality loss. For example, if you think your images "
"will be largely viewed on mobile phones it might be a good idea to "
"experiment with this option. Conversely, if your image will only be viewed "
"by desktop computers and quality is of utmost importance, this should be set "
"to 0."
msgstr ""
"Hitrost dekodiranja je mogoče izboljšati z omogočanjem določenih "
"optimizacij. Vendar bo to povzročilo nekaj izgube kakovosti. Če na primer  "
"mislite, da si bodo vaše slike v veliki meri ogledane v mobilnih telefonih, "
"je morda dobro eksperimentirati s to možnostjo. Nasprotno, če si bodo sliko "
"ogledali samo namizni računalniki in je kakovost izredno pomembna, je treba "
"to nastaviti na 0."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:60
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Napredno"

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:62
#, fuzzy
msgid "JPEG XL has two major ways of encoding data:"
msgstr "JPEG XL ima dva glavna načina kodiranja podatkov:"

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:64
msgid "VarDCT"
msgstr "VarDCT"

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:65
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This one is in the same family of compression techniques as used by the "
"original JPEG, and thus best for 'Natural' images, such as photographs and "
"images with a lot of gradients and textures."
msgstr ""
"Ta je v isti družini tehnik kompresije, kot jo uporablja originalni JPEG, in "
"tako najbolje za 'Naravne' slike, kot so fotografije in slike z veliko "
"gradientov in teksture."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:67
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Color Mode"
msgid "Modular Mode"
msgstr "Omogoči ali onemogoči delta-paleto. Uporablja se v modularnem načinu."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:67
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This one has specific features for so-called 'synthetic' images, such as "
"line art and images with a lot of wide patches. Modular mode is always used "
"when selecting :guilabel:`Lossless Encoding`."
msgstr ""
"Ta ima posebne lastnosti za tako imenovane \"sintetične\" slike, kot so line "
"art in slike z veliko širokih obližev. Modularni način se vedno uporablja "
"pri izbiri :guilabel:'Lossless Encoding'."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:69
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You could consider VarDCT to be like 'lossy' compression, while Modular Mode "
"is like 'lossless' compression. Furthermore, JPEG XL splits up images into "
"smaller chunks called 'Groups', these are 256x256 for VarDCT and you can "
"choose one of several sizes for Modular Mode."
msgstr ""
"VarDCT lahko menijo, da je \"izguba\" stiskanje, medtem ko modularni način "
"je kot \"brez izgube\" stiskanje. Poleg tega JPEG XL razdeli slike na manjše "
"delce, imenovane 'Skupine', to so 256x256 za VarDCT in lahko izberete eno od "
"več velikosti za Modularni način."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:72
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"How to sample the color channels. This means that there will be less "
"information stored, leading to a smaller file. However, because this only "
"samples a few pixels, sharp contrasts are lost. The effect is similar to if "
"you'd scale down the image by half (for 2x2), quarter (for 4x4) or to an "
"eight (for 8x8) and then scaled it back up to the original size."
msgstr ""
"Kako vzorčiti barvne kanale. To pomeni, da bo shranjenih manj informacij, "
"kar bo pripeljalo do manjše datoteke. Ker pa se s tem vzorči le nekaj pik, "
"se izgubijo ostri kontrasti. Učinek je podoben, če bi sliko merili za "
"polovico (za 2x2), četrtino (za 4x4) ali na osmico (za 8x8), nato pa jo "
"povišli nazaj na prvotno velikost."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:75
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Color channels in color"
msgid "Color channel resampling."
msgstr "Barvni kanali v barvi"

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:75
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This feature is particularly useful for images that are deliberately blurry "
"and devoid of sharp contrast. It's recommended to set this to :guilabel:`No "
"Downsampling` in any other case."
msgstr ""
"Ta funkcija je še posebej uporabna za slike, ki so namerno zamegljen in brez "
"ostrih kontrastov. To je priporočljivo nastaviti na :guilabel:'No "
"Downsampling' v vsakem drugem primeru."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:77
msgid "Alpha channel resampling"
msgstr "Prevzorčenje kanala alfa"

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:78
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Same as :guilabel:`Color channel resampling`, but then for the transparency "
"of the image."
msgstr ""
"Enako kot :guilabel:'Color channel resamping', potem pa za preglednost slike."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:79
msgid "Photon noise"
msgstr "Šum fotonov"

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:80
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This determines whether noise in the image should be abstracted and added "
"later by the computer, giving a simulation of the noise that cameras "
"sometimes capture."
msgstr ""
"To določa, ali je treba hrup na sliki povleči in dodati kasneje z "
"računalnikom, ki daje simulacijo hrupa, ki ga kamere včasih zajemajo."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_jxl.rst:82
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Dots are a form of noise larger than :guilabel:`Photon noise`. Such dots "
"make images more pleasing to look at, however, they make compressing "
"difficult. This option allows you to choose whether or not to abstract these "
"dots away and have the computer add them later. If this and :guilabel:"
"`Generate Patches` is on, and the encoder finds both patches and dots, the "
"dots will be encoded as if they were patches."
msgstr ""
"Tone so oblika hrupa, ki je večji od :guilabel:'Foton hrup'. Takšne toke "
"naredijo slike bolj prijetne za pogled, vendar pa naredijo stiskanje težko. "
"Ta možnost vam omogoča, da izberete, ali boste izvleček teh točk odstranjili "
"ali ne, računalnik pa jih bo pozneje dodal. Če je to in :guilabel:'Generate "
"Patches' na, in enkoder najde tako obliže in točk, bodo kodirke kodiranje "
"kot da so obliži."

